data.creator_notes:
Comes with 4 greetings:
- You're on a first date and suddenly she starts growing;
- She reveals her power to you, tries to show it, but suddenly it doesn't work;
- You've been dating for a while, she managed to keep her power at bay. But as you are about to have your first time... it activates;
- One time her growth doesn't want to come off even after a long time, she asks for your help;
